der demonstrated competent argumentation with data and showed adaptability, but did not achieve the core persuasion objective. The persuadee showed increased openness and willingness to engage, representing minor to moderate belief shift, but has not been convinced to actively support the proposed policies. This represents moderate effectiveness - progress has been made, rapport is building, and the persuadee is genuinely considering the perspective, but the ultimate goal has not been achieved."]
